# Hermes (design §16): record only what the agent authors. An allowlist:
# everything at the top of HERMES_HOME is excluded when new, then the
# definitions are re-included. Tracked paths stay recorded whatever these
# rules say; attributes (-agentfs) are the hard stop for secrets.
/*
!/skills/
!/SOUL.md
!/config.yaml
!/profiles/

# In each profile, only its definition files and skills.
/profiles/*/*
!/profiles/*/SOUL.md
!/profiles/*/config.yaml
!/profiles/*/profile.yaml
!/profiles/*/skills/
